@repeat A every 40 until rgb bot 10 10 100 8 113 209 241 20 timeout 4000
@log in the room
@until rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 timeout 6000
@log offer
@repeat A every 40 until rgb bot 100 60 50 40 0 50 72 12 timeout 4000
@log in the battle room
@wait 400
@press UP hold 48 gap 4
@press RIGHT hold 48 gap 10
@until rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 timeout 90 soft
@skipif rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 6
@press DOWN hold 16 gap 10
@until rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 timeout 90 soft
@skipif rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 3
@press UP hold 32 gap 10
@until rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 timeout 90 soft
@skipif rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 0
@until rgb top 10 150 200 12 232 231 232 15 timeout 900
@log on the marker
@until rgb bot 0 180 60 12 2 2 2 6 & rgb top 100 60 50 40 25 76 96 20 timeout 3000
@log selection screen
@wait 60
@press T:64:32 hold 10 gap 60
@press T:179:133 hold 10 gap 60
@press T:204:178 hold 10 gap 90
@log lead entered
@until !rgb top 100 60 50 40 25 76 96 20 timeout 3000
@repeat A every 30 until rgb bot 100 60 50 40 0 50 72 12 & rgb top 100 60 50 40 132 208 187 25 timeout 20000
@log back in the battle room
